            },
            "displayName": "Michael Becke",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "I don't know of a good reason to hash HttpVersions either. I think it is just\ngood practice to override equals() and hashCode() together.\n\nMike",
